JetBrains Mono Nerd Font is JetBrains Mono patched with Nerd Fonts icons
and symbols. This package installs the upstream TrueType fonts,
including all weights, italic styles, and no-ligature (NL) variants.

The package version follows the Nerd Fonts release, not the original
JetBrains Mono version. No compilation or font patching is needed.

Choose a font family in your terminal or application's font settings:
  JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono: single-cell icons for terminal use.
  JetBrainsMono Nerd Font: larger icons where supported.
  JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Propo: proportional icons for GUI use.
The corresponding JetBrainsMonoNL families omit programming ligatures.

For Kitty, for example, set:
  font_family JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono

This package can coexist with SBo's original JetBrainsMono font and
ttf-nerd-fonts-symbols. It does not change your font preferences.
Installation and removal refresh font caches. After removing the
package, select another font in applications configured to use it.
You may need to restart applications to notice font changes.
